@startuml
title Baseline Heavy Request

actor User
participant Tomcat
participant "DashboardService @Transactional" as Service
participant Hikari
database PostgreSQL as Db
participant Partner

User -> Tomcat : GET /api/v1/dashboard/{id}
Tomcat -> Service : handle request
Service -> Hikari : acquire connection
Hikari -> Db : select dashboard + items
Db --> Service : rows
Service -> Partner : HTTP call while Tx is still open
Partner --> Service : delayed response
Service --> Tomcat : DTO
Tomcat --> User : 200 / timeout / error

note over Service,Hikari
Connection is held during partner wait.
Under load this grows Hikari active/pending
and blocks more Tomcat workers.
end note

@enduml
